From 4cd9d158a9e4c8b47abd777c3479a647e6caf91b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenAI <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 22:05:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test(network): compare native and vmnet-helper backends

- Replace the standalone krunkit/cloud-init control with a benchmark-only vmnet-helper backend in the real runtime path.
- Keep native vmnet as the default and select the control backend through a one-shot marker consumed at runtime startup.
- Reuse the sustained P1/P4/P8 benchmark with distinct native and vmnet-helper labels while preserving paired A/B ordering.

Signed-off-by: OpenAI <noreply@example.invalid>
